{"hts_code": "8529.90.8600", "reason": "The handheld unit and the imager cable are integral component parts of a video inspection camera of heading 8525, and neither performs image conversion or processing on its own, so as separately imported parts they fall under subheading 8529.90.86 (parts suitable for use solely or principally with the apparatus of heading 8525), while the complete BK3000-55A scope imported packaged together would instead be classified as a camera of heading 8525."}
